# Scratch logs and dumps. A 421 MB capture reached a commit once, so the rule
# is blanket; the committed artifacts below are exempted.
*.txt
!bwe-baseline.txt
# proptest writes a failing case here and replays it before any new case, so it
# is only useful checked in — otherwise a failure found in CI dies with the
# runner. The blanket rule above would swallow it.
!**/proptest-regressions/**
plans/**
